<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōductĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A lengthening</i>, <i>prolonging</i>
			(class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">productio temporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 3, 14, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verbi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Top. 8, 36</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A lengthening</i> in pronunciation: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut aut contractione brevius fieret, aut
					productione longius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 3, 50, 196</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">voces aut productione aut correptione mutatae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 9, 3, 69</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 7, 9, 13</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
